  "narrative": "Treb likes to go hunting in his free time. In the marshy area behind his house, a flock of ducks likes to hang out. The green grass can sometimes make shooting the ducks difficult, as the ducks will hide behind them. Treb was lucky enough to snipe one duck. However, the shot startled the surrounding ducks, and the ones closest to the grass hid. Treb noticed one duck still sitting out. After getting two ducks, he collects his stuff and leaves. The remaining ducks emerge from the grass to discover only bloody puddles left of their friends.",
